OL,3,GNEWSATwo men arrested after #160k in
OL,4,Acash found in cars
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after about
OL,7,F#160,000 was found in two cars
OL,8,Ftravelling from Merseyside to
OL,9,FManchester.
OL,11,FGreater Manchester Police said it
OL,12,Freceived reports of a suspicious
OL,13,Fvehicle at about 18:00 BST on Friday.
OL,15,FOne vehicle stopped at the Eccles
OL,16,FInterchange junction was found to have
OL,17,Fabout #100,000 in cash inside. Shortly
OL,18,Fafterwards a second vehicle - also
OL,19,Ftravelling to Manchester - was pulled
OL,20,Fover by police and #60,000 was seized.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
